NOTE: The data set WORK.CROPMODEL has 252 observations and 6 variables.
NOTE: The data set WORK.SCORE2 has 36 observations and 13 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE LOGISTIC printed page 1238.

15032      proc logistic inmodel=work.CropModel;
15033      score data=Crops out=Score3;
15034      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SCORE3 has 36 observations and 13 variables.

15035      proc plm source=CropModel2;
15036      score data=Crops out=ScorePLM predicted=p / ilink;
15037      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SCOREPLM has 180 observations and 8 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE PLM printed page 1239.

15038      proc transpose data=ScorePLM out=Score4 prefix=P_ let;
15039      id _LEVEL_;
15040      var p;
15041      by x1-x4 notsorted;
15042      run;

NOTE: There were 180 observations read from the data set WORK.SCOREPLM.
NOTE: The data set WORK.SCORE4 has 36 observations and 11 variables.

15043      data Score4(drop=_NAME_ _LABEL_);
